      {
        "id": "TryndamereQ",
        "name": "Bloodlust",
        "description": "Tryndamere thrives on the thrills of combat, increasing his Attack Damage as he is more and more wounded. He can cast Bloodlust to consume his Fury and heal himself.",
        "tooltip": "<span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">Passive:</span> Tryndamere thirsts for blood, gaining up to <span class=\"text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-500\">20/35/50/65/80 Attack Damage</span> based on his missing Health.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-semibold\">Active:</span> Tryndamere consumes his <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Fury</span>, restoring <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">(30/40/50/60/70 + (30% Ability Power)) plus (0.5/0.95/1.4/1.85/2.3 + (1.2% Ability Power)) Health per Fury (max: (30/40/50/60/70 + (30% Ability Power)))</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Maximum Attack Damage gained at 10% remaining Health.</span>",
